            {
              "id": "1767170795711_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "tcData = {{$context.$nodes.GET_ALL_TIME_CARDS_IN_PENDING_PAYROLL_STATUS_FOR_COMM.$output}} \n\nYour tasks : \n\n1. tcData.items contains a list of timecards\n1. If no entries are found in tcData, do not display any messages and return empty data\n2. If tcData contains data, then analyze this data to identify these as timecards left to be transferred to payroll\n3. Count the number of entries in tcData. Store it in a variable called count\n4. Produce one \"email\" communication to inform the users about <count> timecards pending to be transferred to payroll. Mention the list of workers and their time card dates.\n5. Communication title: 'Send Payroll Manager {count} Time Cards Pending Transfer'\n6. Communication description: 'Remind to review and transfer {count} pending time cards.'\n7. Email subject: 'Actions Required: Timecard Transfer '\n\n\nOutput rules :\n1. The data should be in tabular format\n2. Dates should be in {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERPREFERENCES.$output.items[0].DateFormat}} format"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Retrieve Payload",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var payload = $context.$triggers.REST.$input.OraAction;\nconst jsonMatch = payload.match(/\\(\\{([\\s\\S]*)\\}\\)/);\nvar obj={};\nif (jsonMatch && jsonMatch.length > 1) {\n  obj = JSON.parse(`{${jsonMatch[1]}}`);\n}\nreturn obj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
